# F7 experiment: what if the bridge used equivalence instead of a one-way link?
# Load it with --add, together with the FIBO variant's data. Never use it for real.
@prefix gw:  <https://graphwise.ai/ontology/estx50/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix fibo-be-le-cb: <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/LegalEntities/CorporateBodies/> .

gw:Company owl:equivalentClass fibo-be-le-cb:PubliclyHeldCompany .
